      "content": "thanks. we're also looking at our storage protocols. what are the specific storage temperature requirements for raw poultry to make sure we aren't dealing with any cross-contamination or spoilage issues? we need to be really strict about the hygiene side of things to avoid any unseen risks in the walk-in.",
